{"ref":"character:eleanor-uziron","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Keitha_Muort.gif","w":40,"h":38}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Tides of the Foscari)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Eleanor Uziron is a playable character from the Tides of the Foscari DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellString.png","w":12,"h":14,"r":"weapon:spellstring"}," ",{"t":"SpellString","r":"weapon:spellstring"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["13 April 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Eleanor"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["ELEANOR"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["CharacterControllerEleanor"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-SpellString.png","w":8,"h":10,"r":"weapon:spellstring"}," ",{"t":"SpellString","r":"weapon:spellstring"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Find and open the coffin in Lake Foscari."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Coffin","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-An_Introduction_to_Sorcery.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"An Introduction to Sorcery\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["90"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Growth","cells":[["+25%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+2"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Eleanor is unlocked for purchase by finding and opening her coffin in ",{"t":"Lake Foscari","r":"stage:lake-foscari"},". She needs to be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Eleanor can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"spellsomething\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Eleanor starts with -10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +25% ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},", and +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Upon reaching level 10, 20, and 30, ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStream.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstream"}," ",{"t":"SpellStream","r":"weapon:spellstream"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStrike.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstrike"}," ",{"t":"SpellStrike","r":"weapon:spellstrike"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Academy_Badge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:academy-badge"}," ",{"t":"Academy Badge","r":"passive:academy-badge"}," will spawn underneath her respectively."]}],"subs":[{"id":"passive-bonuses-alternative-starting-weapons","title":"Alternative starting weapons","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Casting the spell \"starpupil\" in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," unlocks two alternative ",{"t":"\"skins\"","r":"relic:mindbender"}," that changes Eleanor's starting weapon to SpellStream or SpellStrike. Her passive bonus at level 10 and 20 are also adjusted accordingly; starting with SpellStream spawns SpellStrike then SpellString, while starting with SpellStrike spawns SpellString then SpellStream."]}]}]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Received weapons from Eleanor's passive effect spawn on the ground, and therefore can be picked up after the max weapon limit, allowing Eleanor to get more than six weapons. This is very useful for uniting them later into ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStrom.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstrom"}," ",{"t":"SpellStrom","r":"weapon:spellstrom"}," without having to rely on levelling up to get all three weapons and taking up weapon slots in the meantime. As a result, gathering all of a player's desired weapons early instead of levelling them up can be beneficial, as this minimizes the amount of time the player has to wait to fill out their weapon slots."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Eleanor_Uziron.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Eleanor Uziron's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Eleanor_Uziron.gif","w":113,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Eleanor_Uziron_-_trailer.png","w":200,"h":126,"c":["Eleanor Uziron as seen in the ",{"t":"launch trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iC4O-_kG11s"}," of Tides of the Foscari."]},{"i":"Tides_of_the_Foscari.png","w":200,"h":115,"c":["Eleanor Uziron as seen in the cover art of Tides of the Foscari (center)."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 15 August 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added alternate starting skins for Eleanor, unlocked via the Spell \"starpupil\""],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Neither skin provides a sprite difference, just a different rotation of starting weapons."]}]}}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 17 August 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed visual issue with Eleanor sprite position after Je-Ne-Viv boss transition."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 13 April 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}